WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:13.280
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.920
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.980
<i>Overlooking the rows of houses and stores</i>

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.390
<i>from the highest vantage,</i>

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.500
<i>Such things as tears and sadness</i>

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:31.640
<i>will quickly vanish</i>

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:37.200
<i>The birds, wind, and sunshine...</i>

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:41.390
<i>...all are your friends</i>

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>I'll carry this dream farther than far</i>

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.550
<i>...no matter the distance...</i>

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:58.310
<i>I long to fly freely</i>

00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:02.590
<i>through the blue sky in my heart...</i>

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.520
<i>The far distant blue sky</i>

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:12.970
<i>It flows into tomorrow</i>

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:25.280
Takara Fansubs

00:01:28.030 --> 00:01:35.170
<i>Accused of theft, Romeo was forced to run from the police.</i>

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:41.930
<i>He dreaded running while Angeletta thought so badly of him,</i>

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:44.760
<i>...but he finally resolved to leave Milan.</i>

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:51.460
<i>But in doing so, he had found himself on the wrong ride.</i>

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:59.080
Episode 14:

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:59.080
Escape, Quickly!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:06.360
Do you know what that carriage is? Do you?!

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:07.810
How should I?

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:11.690
Those two are armed robbers!
The luggage is full of gunpowder!

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:14.290
Say what?! Romeo...!

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:17.690
This is terrible!

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:21.630
Move it! We've got to catch him!

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:23.810
Me?!

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:25.530
You're his friend, aren't you?

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.130
C'mon, let's go!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:40.170
My bro's been itching to get out of that cell, I bet.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:44.600
Oh, we'll get him out soon enough. Just as soon as this...

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.600
...goes kaboom!

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:56.960
It's goodbye to Angeletta, Piccolo.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.060
Move aside!

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.330
Romeo, get out!
Hurry up and get out!

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.720
Which way is it?!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:14.640
This way!

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:21.630
We stopped.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.260
It's the station house!

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:48.150
What are you doing there?
- We're making a delivery.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:51.580
Delivery? Let me see what's inside.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:54.560
Hurry up!

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.980
Sure, sure... we'll show you.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.690
Go on, dear. Show him the contents.
- Right

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:03.310
Stop!

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:07.230
Not that one! Open up this one!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.670
They're all the same!
- Open it, I said!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:12.300
Okay, okay...

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.320
Oh. It's just new chairs...

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:23.730
Have a look in here too, boss.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.770
No, that's plenty!
Just hurry up and carry it in.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.580
Let's get this done FAST.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.490
I can't believe this is going so well!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:43.360
It came off so easy that I'm kind of disappointed.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.670
Now, let's quickly get him out of here.

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.180
<i>What are they up to out there?</i>

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.680
Hey, bro!
- It took you long enough.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.840
I didn't think you were coming.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.900
You see! We came, didn't we?
- I'll open it up.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:04.810
<i>A jailbreak...!</i>

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:08.730
There you are, bro!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:14.680
That's good... but it won't take long for them to notice I'm gone.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.440
We've got gunpowder!

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:17.770
<i>Gunpowder?</i>

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:20.210
We're going to blow the place up!

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:23.450
That way they won't know whether you're alive, dead, gone or what.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:24.690
Oh no!

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:29.600
We've got to run, Piccolo!
So this is gunpowder?!

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.460
Well, well! What a cute guest!

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:39.300
When did you sneak onboard, little boy?

00:05:55.960 --> 00:06:01.010
How do you think it's going to affect Anzelmo?

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:05.050
With rumors going around town that he was the thief?!

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:08.730
What's it to us if Romeo goes to prison?

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:12.210
Yeah! What's it to me if he goes to prison?

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.560
It's not my concern if he gets sent to prison or...

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.220
Hey, Padrone!

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.090
What's wrong?

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:28.320
Oh! Uh, nothing, just passing by, doing my job...

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:33.550
Good, help us out. We're making a poster with Romeo's picture.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:39.010
Cool your heels in here for a bit, kiddie.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:42.690
Are you really going to blow this building up?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.660
Tough luck, kiddie.

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:49.770
Wait!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:56.800
Okay. That should do.

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:00.330
You'll have to get into this box, I'm afraid, bro.

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:03.480
And as soon as we're clear... kaboom! Ya see.

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:04.890
Yes, I get the picture.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:09.540
It's a little cramped, but I'll have to make do for a while.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.660
That's right.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.770
Bye-bye, kiddie-boy!

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.430
Let's be going.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:29.620
Oh my God!

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.930
Somebody! Come quick!

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.560
Somebody! Help!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.920
Is anything the matter, Padrone?
- No, nothing.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:58.120
This hard work sure is getting harder as the years go by, eh?

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.370
It's going to blow! What should I do?

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:23.490
The window!

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.160
Escape! Quickly!

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:50.780
<i>But if I don't tell them, the people in the police station will all...</i>

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.740
I thought there was some good in you...

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:03.010
Oh, how mistaken I was! You're nothing but a sneak and a thief!

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:05.680
The kid stole a hefty sum, from what they say.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:08.260
Sounds like one wicked little monster, all right.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:11.830
He's probably still nearby.
Let's split up and search for him.

00:09:24.150 --> 00:09:25.490
I'm telling them.

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:31.950
And guess what happened next...
- Let me go! Let me go!

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.980
Stop making such a fuss!

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:35.590
Please listen to what I have to say!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.740
What is this all about?
- R... Romeo!

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.080
Boss!

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:42.710
Listen! Run away, quickly!

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:47.490
Some crooks just planted gunpowder in the basement!

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:48.460
Gunpowder?

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.910
Get out, quickly, before it explodes!

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:55.340
Ridiculous! You lying ruffian!

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:58.910
It's true! Run! Quickly!
- Come on!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.520
Come on! Get out!

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:02.830
Run! Quickly! Run!

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.610
Run! Get out!

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:10.960
Where?! Where did they go?

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:13.460
Ah...! There!

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:18.060
Where's Romeo?

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.000
Move it, punk! Outta the way!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.370
Where's Romeo!?

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.640
Hey! He's inside the police station!

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:29.990
Romeo...

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.110
Quick! Run away!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:36.970
Everybody! Run away!

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:40.300
Boss, you too! Quickly!

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:45.680
Hurry up! Run!

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.200
Romeo!

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:20.590
Who did such a terrible thing?
- Isn't it horrible?

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.700
Move! Get out of the road!
- What's wrong with you?

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:29.920
Just what we needed! These people simply won't get out of our way!

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:33.530
We would be very appreciative if you could please help us pass through.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:34.770
Of course.
- That's them!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.880
They're the saboteurs who planted the bomb!

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:38.710
You!

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:42.390
Heavens! We'd never do such a thing!

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.900
Just check the luggage and you'll know real quick.

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:49.800
Open the boxes!

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:02.320
We did it!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:05.520
Romeo!

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:15.520
Are you all right, Padrone?

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:18.960
What happened to me?

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:22.290
There was an explosion.
Romeo was telling the truth.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.520
Romeo!

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:28.150
Romeo! Where are you?

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:37.370
Romeo!

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:43.100
Romeo! Wake up, Romeo! Romeo!

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.500
Thank goodness... He's still alive.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.930
Call a doctor!

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:55.700
Come quick!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.860
Romeo's been caught!

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.670
What was that?!
- Are you serious?

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.060
He caused a terrible accident!

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:10.230
Apparently, he blew up a police station, or something!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:12.980
It was Romeo?

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:14.810
They say he was arrested just now!

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.970
Arrested? Romeo was?

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:21.820
You shouldn't sympathize with him!
He stole your money, after all!

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.290
Yes, he did. He's done wrong.

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:25.240
That's right!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.490
Being arrested is his just deserts.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.900
I've won!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.210
I've finally won!

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.120
Romeo!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:06.520
I owe you my life, Romeo!

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:10.290
And yet look at me!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:26.540
Boss!

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.940
Romeo!
- Thank goodness you're okay.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.550
You, too.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.950
Ow...!
- I'm sorry!

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.600
Are you okay?

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:42.300
I'm fine!
I'm ready to run up a chimney!

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.490
You jerk!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:51.310
Thinking about work at a time like this!

00:14:57.770 --> 00:14:58.670
Boss...?

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.800
What about everybody else?
Is everyone okay?

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:07.070
Yes, they all made it fine.
There were only a few injuries.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.170
Great, thank goodness.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.670
Piccolo! That tickles!

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.170
What, are those tears?

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.660
You're not such a bad fellow after all.

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:25.740
Spare me! What a sideshow!

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:27.900
Hey, wait a minute!

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:35.790
How is he, our little savior?

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.730
He just opened his eyes.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.220
This is Police Chief Moretti.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:41.660
Yes.

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:46.990
Romeo, let's go somewhere quiet.
I'd like to hear your story.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.440
Romeo, this does not mean your slate is clean.

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.990
In fact, as things stand, I'm under obligation to arrest you after this.

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.030
But... one thing baffles me.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:06.140
You were already scot-free. Why come back to the police station?

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:11.960
I did nothing wrong. So I have no intention of running away again!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.080
Even if we throw you into a jail cell?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:27.240
Yes. I'll be here no matter what's coming.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:31.930
Then we've no choice.

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:36.520
Please wait! I guess it's my turn to speak now.

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:46.000
Dear! How did Romeo's interrogation go?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.770
We came to testify!

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:52.300
What's with that sour face?

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.650
Captain! Well, well!

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:58.360
I feel like a weight has been lifted off my chest,

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.610
...now that that good-for-nothing has been arrested!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.990
Well, Captain?
He didn't admit to the theft, did he?!

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.570
Because that boy is an incorrigible liar, you know.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.950
The second he opens his mouth, devil watch out!

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.420
If you take him seriously, why, you're bound to...

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:19.040
Oh?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:24.060
Extract a confession out of Romeo...
- That's enough!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:30.500
Romeo is not the culprit.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:34.200
DEAR!!

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:41.140
This boy did it!
Who else do you think did?!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:42.550
I wonder who?

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:56.400
Anzelmo...

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:01.330
What are you saying I did!?...

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:05.430
It was Romeo! He did it, not me!

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:08.700
Yes, that's right! Romeo's the liar!

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:14.690
Romeo hasn't told a single lie.
I'll stand by Romeo's word.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:16.320
I will, too.

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:19.920
I've already told them everything.

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:25.250
Wh... What the heck do you know, Dad?!

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:28.910
Anzelmo! Would you dare say that to your sister?

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:33.760
What're you doing!?
- Shut up!

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:35.810
Now apologize to Romeo!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:40.260
If what they just said is the truth, I'm right about to punch you out!

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:46.060
You know that Angeletta is probably worried sick, don't you?

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:55.690
Anzelmo...

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:06.000
Well? What do we do with him?
Shall we bring him up on theft?

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:10.720
No, it's a family matter. I'll take responsibility for his punishment at home.

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.370
Mom!

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:17.860
I've never been so embarrassed in my entire life!

00:19:18.220 --> 00:19:21.650
Just wait and see! Because I'm not going to let this go just like that!

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:24.720
I apologize for all the trouble.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.730
Good luck, Romeo.
- Thank you.

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:33.140
Hey, Romeo!

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:34.570
Dante!

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.210
Look at that bandage! What a melodramatic guy you are!

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.810
Heh... yeah, that's true...
- Romeo.

00:19:41.470 --> 00:19:42.060
Yes?

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:46.610
I promise from now on not to make things hard for you.

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:48.680
You're free from today on.
- Free?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:54.630
Yes. Free to see Angeletta, and be a good friend to her!

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:57.430
She's been waiting for you, Romeo.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:09.420
Waiting for me?

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.050
Thank goodness, eh, Romeo?

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:22.860
Of course it's all thanks to me, Dante, the Great Detective...

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.630
Thank you, boss!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:30.800
Hey! Aren't you hurt...?

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.220
<i>I'm free!</i>

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.430
<i>I've been set free!</i>

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.800
<i>I can come back... to you...!</i>

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:57.820
Angeletta.

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:02.190
Romeo...!

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:25.570
<i>That day, Rossi removed the bars from Romeo's room.</i>

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:30.130
<i>Romeo had finally become truly free.</i>

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:36.460
<i>I'm going to see my best friend.</i>

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:39.990
<i>After so long, I'll finally be able to see you again, Alfredo!</i>

00:21:55.610 --> 00:21:59.300
While searching for my best friend Alfredo, I became lost in the alleyways.

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:02.710
There I ran into other young chimney sweeps.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:06.020
What? You're acquainted with Alfredo?

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:10.820
See you then!

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:10.820
<i>Strike a Light!
The Oath of the Eleven</i>

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:10.820
Next time:

00:22:13.090 --> 00:22:17.090
<i>"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"</i>

00:22:25.700 --> 00:22:29.800
<i>Si Si Ciao, why do the good times</i>

00:22:29.900 --> 00:22:34.100
<i>seem to end so soon?</i>

00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:38.300
<i>Si Si Ciao, we're all friends</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:42.500
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:47.410
<i>Your laughing voice dances</i>

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:51.310
<i>Once again in the sky</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:58.610
<i>Your pocket bursting with memories</i>

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:04.210
<i>Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now</i>

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:08.410
<i>Let's meet again on these Roman roofs</i>
